8. Only two things change: which motif is active, and how many magenta cells remain.
9. Deactivate: `O`→`W`, `p`→`g`. Activate: `W`→`O`, `g`→`p`.
10. Magenta consumption: rightmost `M` on row 63 becomes `W`.
11. **Goal:** navigate the cursor from the start motif (top-left green block) to the target motif (top-right white block) within the magenta budget.

